Z||000023||Seanh||01-14-2001||12:33 PM||||I found this site that has a pretty good explination of how to keep it clean and stuff. <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/engine.html#clean" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"It's always in the last place you look." Of course it is. Why would you keep looking after you've found it? Do people do this? Who and where are they?</I>||||reg||1
